{
    "title": "Wireless Display",
    "description": "Little smartphone and tablet screens are good on the run, but when you\u2019re in your family area then why not use your TV\u2019s much larger screen instead? Sharing your phone screen With the Television now is easier with this Connect Phone To TV App.\r\n\u2028\r\nEasy to use, just choose your all-media and press to play, a step to play it on your TV!\r\nAnytime and anywhere, from any device's Wireless Display enjoy\r\nwith your friends and family with Wireless Display on your wifi phone\r\nstream, you can play your favorite photos, videos, and music any\r\nthe way you like, like all screen TV nearby. Moments with everyone to\r\nsee and hear\u00a0\u00a0\r\n\u2028\r\n\u00a0\u00a0Features:\r\n* Cast Android screen to TV screen (Smart TV must support Wireless Display / Miracast).\r\n* Find devices support show screencast in the current wifi network.\r\n* The custom curve of the phone corner and quick access to the application form notification bar.\r\n\u2028\r\n- Simply open the application, and tap Start \"WiFi Display\" and then sync\r\nyour device to the desired display which you want to mirror your screen\r\n\u2028\r\n- This app will help you scan and reflect your phone's screen or Android\r\ntab on TV / Display (cast Mira enabled) or Wireless dongles or\r\nadapters\r\n\u2028\r\n\u2028\r\nPlease follow the steps below to display your mobile screen on your TV:\r\n\u2028\r\n* - Make sure your TV and your Phone are Connected to the same wifi network\r\n* - Enable Miracast Display on your TV\r\n* - Enable Wireless Display option on your phone\r\n* - Click Select button and choose your TV\r\n* - Enjoy!\r\n\u2028\r\nScreen Mirroring is supported by all Android devices and Android Versions.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Little smartphone and tablet screens are good on the run, but when you\u2019re in your family area then why not use your TV\u2019s much larger screen instead? Sharing your phone screen With the Television now is easier with this Connect Phone To TV App.<br>\u2028<br>Easy to use, just choose your all-media and press to play, a step to play it on your TV!<br>Anytime and anywhere, from any device&#39;s Wireless Display enjoy<br>with your friends and family with Wireless Display on your wifi phone<br>stream, you can play your favorite photos, videos, and music any<br>the way you like, like all screen TV nearby. Moments with everyone to<br>see and hear\u00a0\u00a0<br>\u2028<br>\u00a0\u00a0Features:<br>* Cast Android screen to TV screen (Smart TV must support Wireless Display / Miracast).<br>* Find devices support show screencast in the current wifi network.<br>* The custom curve of the phone corner and quick access to the application form notification bar.<br>\u2028<br>- Simply open the application, and tap Start &quot;WiFi Display&quot; and then sync<br>your device to the desired display which you want to mirror your screen<br>\u2028<br>- This app will help you scan and reflect your phone&#39;s screen or Android<br>tab on TV / Display (cast Mira enabled) or Wireless dongles or<br>adapters<br>\u2028<br>\u2028<br>Please follow the steps below to display your mobile screen on your TV:<br>\u2028<br>* - Make sure your TV and your Phone are Connected to the same wifi network<br>* - Enable Miracast Display on your TV<br>* - Enable Wireless Display option on your phone<br>* - Click Select button and choose your TV<br>* - Enjoy!<br>\u2028<br>Screen Mirroring is supported by all Android devices and Android Versions.",
